@startuml message_passing_adapter_request_flow
!theme plain
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam shadowing false

title Client-Side Request and Response

actor Application
participant "MessagePassingControlClient" as Client
participant "ClientSession" as ClientSession
participant "PendingCallRegistry" as PendingRegistry
participant "PendingCall" as PendingCall
participant "FlatBufferCodec" as Codec
participant "IClientConnection" as ClientConnection
participant "SCORE message-passing IPC" as Transport

Application -> Client: SendRequest(request)
Client -> ClientSession: SendRequest(request)
ClientSession -> ClientSession: WaitForConnectionReady()
ClientSession -> PendingRegistry: Register()
PendingRegistry --> ClientSession: request_id, pending call
ClientSession -> Codec: SerializeRequest(request)
Codec --> ClientSession: request bytes
ClientSession -> ClientConnection: **IClientConnection::Send(bytes)**
ClientConnection -> Transport: Request frame

note over ClientSession, PendingCall
	WaitForResponse(request_id, deadline + grace) blocks the caller.
	The transport response callback completes the pending call asynchronously.
end note

Transport --> ClientConnection: Response frame
ClientConnection -> ClientSession: **OnResponseBytes(bytes) callback**
ClientSession -> Codec: DeserializeResponse(bytes)
Codec --> ClientSession: ControlResponse
ClientSession -> PendingRegistry: Complete(request_id, response)
PendingRegistry -> PendingCall: Complete(response)
ClientSession --> Client: Return response
Client --> Application: Return response

@enduml